### About me
{:.first-heading}

I am a computational linguist, research assistant, and doctoral student at the
[Department of Linguistics](http://www.linguistics.rub.de/) at [Ruhr-Universität
Bochum](http://www.rub.de/).

My research interests include corpus linguistics, (semi-)automatic annotation,
processing of non-standard language varieties, and natural language generation.

I currently work in various research projects related to [computational
historical linguistics](http://www.linguistics.rub.de/comphist/) supervised by
[Stefanie Dipper](http://www.linguistics.rub.de/~dipper/).


